# Keep the warmed replay cache: it is what makes the demo reproducible offline.
# The warmed response cache IS committed on purpose: it is what makes `--provider replay`
# reproduce a known-good run offline in ~50 s instead of 13 minutes, with no daemon, no keys
# and no quota. 155 KB, and it is the demo-day safety net.
!.specalive_cache/

# Visual Studio per-user workspace state (created when the folder is opened in VS).
.vs/
